    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113616" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρογρᾰφ-εω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>report in writing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				72.465
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>give a guarantee by note of hand,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				48.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>: c. inf.
			fut., ib.<i><span class="en">
				66.59
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>: but, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> esp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. τὸν βασιλικὸν ὅρκον</span>
			<i>subscribe to</i> the royal oath, <i>make an</i> attested
				<i>declaration, PRev. Laws</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				27.5
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, etc.</div>
